 * See docs/vendor/framework7-v9.2.0/LICENSE.
 * Isolated native components own their hit areas and surfaces. The existing
 * flat writing/content hierarchy and fixed action docks remain page-owned.
 * Textarea, consent switches, native routing, private media/avatar readers,
